Z||000000||Eric Marsh||09-11-2000||04:23 PM||||I'm having overheating problems on my V8 Fiero. One of the things I'm considering is a new electric radiator fan. However power consumption is also an issue as this car chews up fan belts when it has too high an electrical load. Does anyone have any idea how much power the stock fan pulls? How much air is it rated to at?<P>Thanks,<P>Eric<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||5
