Z||000003||fsrowsell||09-11-2000||07:32 PM||||Eric, the stock fan did not cut it for me either. So I replaced it with a Permacool fan. Part #19114 14". It works great... Lots of air and no over heating problems... <A HREF="http://www.permacool.com/Catalog/Cat_page16.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.permacool.com/Catalog/Cat_page16.html</A> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||09-11-2000||10:17 PM||||If you are eating fan belts when the alternator loads you likely have a crappy alternator. You could also be over tight on the belts. (try another brand of belt if you can.)||||reg||1
