Z||000008||fsrowsell||09-12-2000||07:21 PM||||The Permacool fan that I told Eric aboout is a very powerful fan. I think something like 2900cfm. you can check their web site for that. It took me about 10 minutes to do mine and that was including taking the old one off. It was very easy and all the hardware came with the fan. I bought mine from Summit. <BR>||||reg||1
